# EarthTrend 3D requires NO API keys, tokens or secrets.
#
# All data sources are free, public and keyless:
#   - NASA GIBS    https://gibs.earthdata.nasa.gov
#   - NASA POWER   https://power.larc.nasa.gov
#   - Open-Meteo   https://open-meteo.com  (wind vectors only)
#
# This file exists to document that fact for reviewers and hosting providers,
# and to reserve the names below if optional endpoints are added later.
#
# Optional overrides (uncomment only if you self-host a proxy):
# VITE_GIBS_BASE_URL=https://gibs.earthdata.nasa.gov
# VITE_POWER_BASE_URL=https://power.larc.nasa.gov
# VITE_OPEN_METEO_BASE_URL=https://api.open-meteo.com
